OL,3,GNEWSACalls for better network after
OL,4,Avillage goes offline
OL,5,
OL,6,FInternet outages in a Surrey village
OL,7,Fleft people "unable to carry out daily
OL,8,Ftasks" for two days, prompting calls
OL,9,Ffor better connectivity in rural parts
OL,10,Fof the county.
OL,12,FParts of Charlwood lost access to
OL,13,Fbroadband services on Monday and
OL,14,FTuesday, with the impact amplified by
OL,15,Fpoor 4G and 5G reception in the area.
OL,17,FThe problems have led to the Dorking
OL,18,Fand Horley MP pushing for the
OL,19,Fgovernment and companies to improve
OL,20,Fmobile signal in more rural areas of
OL,21,Fthe constituency.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
