OL,3,GNEWSACalls for better network after
OL,4,Avillage goes offline
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenreach, which operates the broadband
OL,7,Fnetwork in the area, apologised for the
OL,8,Fdisruption and confirmed services were
OL,9,Fnow working again.
